---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
import { SITE } from "../data/site";
---

<Base og="about" title="About" description="About Aidan McAlister, a developer advocate and TypeScript engineer in Boston.">
  <PageHeader title="About" />
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm a developer advocate and TypeScript engineer in Boston. I work on the parts of a developer
      product that decide whether people stick around: the docs, the tooling, and the community.
    </p>
    <p>
      As a developer advocate at <a href="https://www.prisma.io" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-describedby="new-tab">Prisma</a>, I rebuilt the Prisma docs (400+ pages, and we kept about 90% of search traffic through the move),
      built <a href="https://github.com/prisma/create-db" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-describedby="new-tab">create-db</a> solo, made the docs readable by AI
      agents with <a href="https://llmstxt.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-describedby="new-tab">llms.txt</a>, built the prisma.io homepage for the v7 launch and the Prisma Postgres product page, and helped grow the Discord community past 10,000 members.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before that I was a front end developer at Inner Armor, where I rebuilt an abandoned admin
      dashboard in Remix that the whole company ended up using. Before that, as a contractor at Elevate
      Digital, I built CRUD interfaces and a filter and search system in <a href="https://rwsdk.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-describedby="new-tab">RedwoodJS</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      On the side I build things like <a href="https://clasp.sh" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-describedby="new-tab">clasp.sh</a>. Right now I'm building
      citable, a CLI that scores a website for search and AI visibility, then hands the fixes to your
      coding agent.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm looking for my next role in developer relations or frontend and devtools engineering. Email is the
      best way to reach me: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. My
      <a href={SITE.resume}>resume</a> has the details.
    </p>
  </div>

</Base>
